   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "flanneld never sees your pod. It acts at start (subnet.env, flannel.1) and when a node joins or leaves (adds or removes that node's route\nthrough flannel.1). The IP comes from host-local, run by containerd through the CNI binaries. Packets are then forwarded by the kernel, not by flanneld.",
   "originalText": "flanneld never sees your pod. It acts at start (subnet.env, flannel.1) and when a node joins or leaves (adds or removes that node's route\nthrough flannel.1). The IP comes from host-local, run by containerd through the CNI binaries. Packets are then forwarded by the kernel, not by flanneld.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
